{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國便利店CU新品！今次是將 Pokémon變成雪葩，超級可愛！暫時公布了兩個寵物小精靈的雪葩：百變怪和比卡超！神還原他們可愛的樣貌，百變怪標誌的笑容；比卡超高高聳立的招牌小耳朵到紅通通的蘋果肌，連舉起雙手的萌樣都精緻還原！大家到韓國旅行去尋找小精靈啦！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179138883794117097_945608566ac66ca662b61.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179138884003676138_10538994936ac66ca8656a4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179138884163376331_11515789806ac66caaa4864.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179138884498227914_18698650826ac66cad7956b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179138884712380280_6030132376ac66caf948b6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179138884931656404_1440585956ac66cb1bb878.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T16:20:35.297640+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}